<title>USA: CliniCorp files reorganization plan.</title>
<headline>CliniCorp files reorganization plan.</headline>
<dateline>WEST PALM BEACH, FLA. 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>CliniCorp Inc said Friday it filed a reorganization and joint disclosure plan with the U.S. Bankruptcy Court on December 13.</p>
<p>The company, operating under Chapter 11 bankruptcy, said it filed the plan with Trident Medical Concepts Inc, and will merge with Trident pending the plan's approval.</p>
<p>Clinicorp, a clinic management company, said in September it had signed a letter of intent to reorganize with Trident, a health care firm specializing in physician group management.</p>
<p>CliniCorp officials were not immediately available to comment.</p>
